# Template for the real config/claude.env, which is created by
# `hermes-connect` (Milestone 2) on the target instance and is git-ignored.
# Claude Code's own login flow may manage most of this outside a plain
# env file (see SECURITY.md §3) — this template covers what Hermes itself
# needs to know to launch it. Do not put a real value here — it is
# committed to Git.

CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=REPLACE_ME
